# Treat torch checkpoint / tensor cache files as binary: disable line-ending
# conversion (autocrlf) and textual diffing. Without this, git can rewrite
# CRLF/LF bytes inside these files on checkout/commit, corrupting the
# torch.save pickle stream (the symptom: torch.load fails after a checkout or
# a "rollback of a deletion" restores a previously mangled blob).
*.pt -text
*.pth -text
*.npz -text -diff
*.pkl -text
